      "text": "Same content, same live feed, Hawaiʻi Island at 12:50 PM.\nLeft is exactly what ships now, on the brown ground.\nRight moves to a warm white with white cards. Hue appears only in the icon tile and the label — no card is filled except the one carrying emphasis.",
